      "content": "<strong>अध्याय 3: शब्द भण्डार</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "The Constitution is not a mere lawyers' document, it is a vehicle of Life, and its spirit is always the spirit of Age.",
      "id": "fcg85fc"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "m6jnqpc",
      "content": "<strong>  3.1 पर्यायवाची शब्द (Synonyms)  </strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "da3fv4k",
      "content": "एक ही अर्थ को व्यक्त करने वाले भिन्न-भिन्न शब्दों को पर्यायवाची या समानार्थी शब्द कहते हैं।"
    },
